== Trivia ==
* This item originates from the Antibirth mod, but it was unobtainable due to a bug. It also had two scrapped abilities that made Attack Flies turn into Blue Flies when encountered and blocked tears home in on enemies. Psy Fly was originally unlocked by completing {{chal|Isaac's Awakening}}.

